      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ITSMENOTU (6) has recorded two wins and two minor placings from the past five starts. Added to her reputation at her latest appearance when she got the job done by 12 metres over 2090m at Hobart. Tackles a similar assignment and she can go right on with the job. SHOOBEES SPIRIT (3) finished second at his most recent outing, beaten 7 metres, in a nice return to form at this track over 2200m. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a comparable field so he can salute this time around. CAN FEEL THE FURY NZ (1) must be considered after he finished third over 2090m at Hobart a week-and-a-half ago. WEE GEORGIE WOOD (10) was out of the money two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished a long last over 1680m at this track. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. Has the talent to make his presence felt.",
